    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new ways to solve puzzles!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect is a puzzle-platformer where you control beams of light to progress through a mysterious simulation. Each redirection unlocks new areas, reveals hidden mechanics, and peels back layers of a dark, carefully crafted narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a focus on atmosphere and discovery, Redirect is more than puzzles....it's about breaking free from control and uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=798 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn about the world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up trapped in a world that feels artificial........because it is. Redirect is set within a corrupted simulation controlled by the powerful ATOMIX Corporation. As you manipulate beams of light to navigate and survive, you begin to uncover fragments of a forgotten past, hidden truths, and a rebellion long erased from memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something.....or someone....is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything wants you to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not everything you see is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=800 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; \ud83d\udd26 50+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83e\udde0 Mind-bending light-based puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Immersive sci-fi narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Built-in Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new ways to solve puzzles!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect is a puzzle-platformer where you control beams of light to progress through a mysterious simulation. Each redirection unlocks new areas, reveals hidden mechanics, and peels back layers of a dark, carefully crafted narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a focus on atmosphere and discovery, Redirect is more than puzzles....it's about breaking free from control and uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=798 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/4d2ffe6fc52677250ec2ed7fdc280456.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn about the world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up trapped in a world that feels artificial........because it is. Redirect is set within a corrupted simulation controlled by the powerful ATOMIX Corporation. As you manipulate beams of light to navigate and survive, you begin to uncover fragments of a forgotten past, hidden truths, and a rebellion long erased from memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something.....or someone....is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything wants you to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not everything you see is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=800 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/24222be9b0fe9bcf8389d0c9b9096d2d.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; \ud83d\udd26 50+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83e\udde0 Mind-bending light-based puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Immersive sci-fi narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &gt; \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Built-in Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.poster.avif?t=1753372609\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.webm?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/ed5d791d7e1037b5c5bbf5f089666cc0.mp4?t=1753372609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388350/extras/1d9a0d794a2b32de35f4ebc4856c0349.avif?t=1753372609\" width=1600 height=14 /></span></p>",
